As the covering $\mathcal{U}$ is good, we can lift $g_{ij}$ up to $\widetilde{g}_{ij} : U_{ij} \to \widetilde{G}$ of $g_{ij}$, this means that the following diagram is commutative
\begin{equation}
\xymatrix{
& \widetilde{G} \ar[d]_p
\\
